      "content": "people dont want to help, they just want to feel like they did something so they can stop feeling awkward about it. it's just a loop of pretending things matter when they really dont. sometimes i think the emptiness is the only honest thing left. it's like the world is just moving on without me and there's nothing to do but watch.",
